        <body>
            <div xml:id="d578">

                <pb facs="0513" n="397" sameAs="frus:frus1912/pg397"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 822.00/223.]</note>
                <head ana="#head_untitled-inferred-from-preceding-sibling-head">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1912-01-23">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">January 23, 1912</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Guayaquil now occupied by Government troops. Consular corps there have made
                    representations regarding disposition to be made <pb facs="0514" n="398"
                        xml:id="pg398"/> of prominent prisoners, among whom are Eloy Alfaro and
                    Pedro Montero. I have instructed our Consul General to take no part in such
                    action, leaving the question to the Government of Ecuador entirely.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Young.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
